/E (I extend my special thanks to my supervisor, Ms. SKANDER Amina, for her dedication, availability, and guidance throughout my internship. Her constant support and invaluable advice have enabled me to progress significantly, both technically and professionally. Thanks to her mentorship, I was able to thrive in a stimulating, enriching, and learning-conducive environment. I particularly appreciated her pedagogical approach, which seamlessly combined rigor with encouragement, allowing me to fully realize my potential.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
