248 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 164 0 R
/E (In modern engineering applications, embedded systems are no longer limited to simple control tasks. They now form the core of complex systems such as autonomous robotics, industrial automation, aerospace control systems, and real-time signal processing platforms. This evolution is largely driven by the increasing demand for systems that combine computation, sensing, and actuation within a unified architecture.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
